{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>銅鑼灣發生交通意外。今日（15日）下午約1時半，一名老翁在希慎道近利園山道的行人過路處過路時，被一輛的士撞傷；他胸口痛，幸仍清醒，由救護車送往瑪麗醫院治理。</p><p>現場圖片可見，傷者倒臥馬路中，初時有兩名男途人從旁施援；其後救護員趕至，為其戴上頭部固定器救援。警方正調查意外原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"大批警員及救護員到場。（Threads / inurmind_99）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187411272485048320041935.jpeg/xWmrjulcY96tDLBmQi0jwHIvxTsZj1CLMFhphTBYaYU\"/><figcaption>大批警員及救護員到場。（Threads / inurmind_99）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救護員趕至為傷者戴上頭部固定器救援。（Threads / inurmind_99）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187411270287101952956204.jpeg/K4023o2SMCY5IuGLMkqxMV_8WmbLjYibQVKMP0FSjD8\"/><figcaption>救護員趕至為傷者戴上頭部固定器救援。（Threads / inurmind_99）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"老翁被銅鑼灣希慎道近利園山道被的士撞到，受傷倒地，初時有兩名男途人從旁施援。（Threads / inurmind_99）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187411267929772032205431.jpeg/BFryrSnKufAAGqnqCmsbxykPxAPNaZrT-Tsdxvk7HcY\"/><figcaption>老翁被銅鑼灣希慎道近利園山道被的士撞到，受傷倒地，初時有兩名男途人從旁施援。（Threads / inurmind_99）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:34.321429+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":276,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T06:43:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T13:18:06.124708+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:49.985517+00:00","content_hash":"910e98406164553687ff7ed9a546bf377f651f8834c626f6d5794386b2a39978","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}